//- Community — the Discord.
//-
//- This section used to read "Join the expedition · trade routes, compare digs
//- … the camp gathers on Discord", which promises a crowd. On launch week there
//- is no crowd, and a visitor who takes that promise and finds a quiet room has
//- been told something worse than nothing — that nobody is playing this yet.
//-
//- So the offer is now the one a small server can actually keep: the person who
//- built the game is in there and answers. That is true today, stays true at any
//- size, and is a better reason to join than an implied population.
include icons

mixin discord(links)
  section#community.community(data-screen-label="Join the Discord")
    .community__inner
      .section-head
        .ornament
          span.rule
          span.diamond
          span.rule
        h2.h2 Talk to the person who made it
        p.serif-italic Buried Worlds VR was built by one person in Victoria, and he is on the Discord most days. It is a direct line for questions and bug reports, and the first place new destinations get argued about.
      a.btn.btn--primary.btn--icon.community__cta(href=links.discord target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer")
        +discordIcon(20)
        span Join the Discord
